<title>USA: Morgan Products buys millwork product co.</title>
<headline>Morgan Products buys millwork product co.</headline>
<dateline>WILLIAMSBURG, Va. 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Products Ltd said Friday that it has completed its previously announced acquisition of Wahlfeld Manufacturing Co, a distributor of Andersen products and other millwork products.</p>
</text>
